WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.690
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:46.960 --> 01:51.800
[Episode 10]

3
02:06.400 --> 02:08.280
Why are you back?

4
02:09.385 --> 02:11.412
I was about to ask you the same thing.

5
02:11.412 --> 02:13.680
Didn't you say you went back home?

6
02:13.680 --> 02:15.080
Why are you here alone?

7
02:15.080 --> 02:16.160
Oh...

8
02:16.160 --> 02:18.880
Well, my parents...

9
02:18.880 --> 02:20.759
They decided to go on a trip at the last minute.

10
02:20.759 --> 02:23.213
So, I came back early.

11
02:23.213 --> 02:25.533
Did you spend the New Year all by yourself?

12
02:39.013 --> 02:40.813
Is this what you ate last night?

13
02:43.252 --> 02:45.053
Yeah.

14
02:45.053 --> 02:46.353
Shen Mo.

15
02:51.733 --> 02:53.033
Come here.

16
03:34.000 --> 03:37.652
Didn't you say you were going to stay abroad for a few more days?

17
03:37.652 --> 03:39.772
Why are you back so soon?

18
03:42.293 --> 03:44.172
Something urgent came up.

19
03:46.252 --> 03:47.932
I changed my plans.

20
03:48.733 --> 03:50.293
What happened?

21
03:50.293 --> 03:52.093
You know the answer.

22
03:53.546 --> 03:56.625
How did you know that I didn't go back home...

23
03:56.625 --> 03:58.240
and spent the New Year alone?

24
03:58.240 --> 04:00.521
I realized it when I called last night.

25
04:02.025 --> 04:03.545
It's a bit late now.

26
04:04.800 --> 04:06.386
It's not late.

27
04:06.386 --> 04:07.546
You rushed back...

28
04:07.546 --> 04:09.545
It must have been hard to book a flight.

29
04:11.465 --> 04:12.946
Those are all problems...

30
04:12.946 --> 04:14.666
that money can solve.

31
04:16.346 --> 04:18.960
Are there problems money can't solve?

32
04:18.960 --> 04:20.560
Yes.

33
04:23.986 --> 04:25.511
Like...

34
04:29.385 --> 04:31.945
Like how to make someone fall in love with me.

35
04:32.945 --> 04:35.505
Isn't it enough that I like you?

36
04:35.505 --> 04:37.425
Who else do you want to like you?

37
04:41.065 --> 04:42.786
Say it again.

38
04:49.466 --> 04:51.745
I like you.

39
05:13.106 --> 05:14.706
Don't say a word.

40
06:45.346 --> 06:48.386
Give yourself to me... please?

41
07:07.584 --> 07:09.183
No...

42
07:10.466 --> 07:12.505
It's too tight.

43
07:12.505 --> 07:13.705
Don't go.

44
07:13.705 --> 07:15.706
Please.

45
07:18.305 --> 07:19.945
I love you.

46
07:27.026 --> 07:29.305
You asked for this.

47
08:11.885 --> 08:14.306
Did that hurt?

48
08:14.306 --> 08:15.906
A little.

49
08:17.586 --> 08:18.786
Give me your hand.

50
08:18.786 --> 08:20.720
Huh?

51
08:20.720 --> 08:22.080
What's this?

52
08:25.666 --> 08:27.490
And this is...

53
08:29.906 --> 08:31.945
A New Year's gift for you.

54
08:32.946 --> 08:35.306
I forgot about it earlier.

55
08:35.306 --> 08:38.625
We've been together for so long.

56
08:38.625 --> 08:40.965
Why are you being so cheesy?

57
08:42.226 --> 08:45.505
Won't your family be upset that you came back early?

58
08:45.505 --> 08:47.545
Oh. My younger sister...

59
08:47.545 --> 08:48.866
Your sister?

60
08:48.866 --> 08:51.225
Aren't you the only child?

61
08:53.560 --> 08:54.866
What about you?

62
08:54.866 --> 08:56.906
You didn't go home for New Year's.

63
09:02.400 --> 09:04.000
You don't want to talk about it?

64
09:04.879 --> 09:07.358
Actually, there's no special reason.

65
09:08.145 --> 09:09.946
It's just...

66
09:09.946 --> 09:13.065
It's just that my parents kicked me out again.

67
09:13.706 --> 09:14.745
You know why.

68
09:14.745 --> 09:17.080
Last summer...

69
09:17.080 --> 09:19.612
I told them about our relationship.

70
09:19.612 --> 09:21.972
My family is quite traditional.

71
09:21.972 --> 09:23.413
How could they ever accept it?

72
09:23.413 --> 09:24.933
Especially my father.

73
09:24.933 --> 09:26.492
So...

74
09:27.492 --> 09:30.252
So, you're all alone now.

75
09:30.252 --> 09:31.413
How can you say that?

76
09:31.413 --> 09:33.372
Don't I still have you?

77
09:35.933 --> 09:37.492
What's wrong?

78
09:37.492 --> 09:39.853
We won't ever be apart, right?

79
09:42.000 --> 09:44.040
We won't break up, will we?

80
09:44.933 --> 09:46.233
Of course not.

81
09:50.572 --> 09:52.173
But for now...

82
09:52.972 --> 09:56.572
you need to dry your hair properly.

83
09:56.572 --> 09:58.412
Or else, you'll get a headache.

84
10:38.572 --> 10:42.772
Since that day, Zhou Yang has been sleeping with me.

85
10:45.653 --> 10:47.173
Stop working.

86
10:47.173 --> 10:49.012
Come to bed.

87
10:50.692 --> 10:52.692
Okay, fine.

88
10:52.692 --> 10:54.292
In a moment.

89
10:57.212 --> 10:58.813
No more working!

90
11:11.960 --> 11:14.720
Geez, why were you so fierce just now?

91
11:14.720 --> 11:16.320
Am I not allowed to be?

92
11:22.133 --> 11:24.493
When my hand heals and I can paint again,

93
11:24.493 --> 11:26.652
I'll find a job as an artist.

94
11:26.652 --> 11:28.612
I'll support you then.

95
11:31.400 --> 11:33.652
You're going to support me?

96
11:33.652 --> 11:34.952
Yeah.

97
11:41.013 --> 11:42.572
All right, then.

98
11:43.692 --> 11:45.452
I'll wait for you to support me.

99
12:28.973 --> 12:31.492
We're back at our old home.

100
13:22.120 --> 13:25.160
[Shen Mo]

101
14:15.960 --> 14:17.559
A graduation photo.

102
14:20.452 --> 14:23.013
Isn't Zhou Yang in the graduation photo?

103
14:31.253 --> 14:33.852
Who is this in the photo with me?

104
14:38.052 --> 14:39.573
This isn't Zhou Yang.

105
14:39.573 --> 14:40.612
Or rather...

106
14:40.612 --> 14:43.772
this isn't the Zhou Yang I've been living with day and night.

107
14:43.772 --> 14:45.693
Then who is this person?

108
14:51.493 --> 14:53.493
If this person isn't Zhou Yang,

109
14:53.493 --> 14:56.133
why did I have so much to do with him?

110
15:00.532 --> 15:03.133
And if this person is Zhou Yang...

111
15:23.932 --> 15:25.573
Zhou Yang.

112
15:25.573 --> 15:26.932
You're back.

113
15:26.932 --> 15:29.253
I'm not Zhou Yang.

114
15:29.253 --> 15:31.093
And Zhou Yang isn't coming back.

115
15:31.093 --> 15:32.773
Whether you keep running away,

116
15:34.040 --> 15:35.893
or wake up and face reality,

117
15:35.893 --> 15:38.120
it's your choice.

118
15:38.120 --> 15:40.013
Zhou Yang.

119
15:40.013 --> 15:42.372
Zhou Yang, come back!

120
15:43.840 --> 15:46.000
Zhou Yang went abroad.

121
15:47.652 --> 15:49.252
He's not coming back.

122
15:50.932 --> 15:53.173
You should start a new life.

123
15:54.600 --> 15:56.721
It's good that you're back.

124
16:15.893 --> 16:16.973
You...

125
16:16.973 --> 16:18.732
Why are you here?

126
16:19.692 --> 16:21.292
Oh.

127
16:21.292 --> 16:23.293
There wasn't much to do at the office,

128
16:24.013 --> 16:25.893
so I came to see you.

129
16:31.253 --> 16:33.372
You've started painting again.

130
16:33.973 --> 16:35.532
Yes.

131
16:35.532 --> 16:36.972
It's beautiful.

132
16:41.733 --> 16:43.173
What's wrong?

133
16:45.812 --> 16:47.333
Why are your hands so cold?

134
16:47.333 --> 16:48.910
Are you too tired?

135
16:49.733 --> 16:51.333
Yeah.

136
16:51.333 --> 16:53.932
I know you want to paint again,

137
16:53.932 --> 16:56.092
but don't push yourself too hard.

138
16:56.932 --> 16:58.972
Just let it happen naturally.

139
17:04.773 --> 17:06.573
Are you finished?

140
17:06.573 --> 17:08.093
If you are...

141
17:09.732 --> 17:11.653
Then let's go home.

142
17:17.840 --> 17:19.140
Okay.

143
17:20.452 --> 17:22.333
He's not Zhou Yang.

144
17:23.293 --> 17:26.252
Who is this person I've been living with all this time?

145
17:31.972 --> 17:33.272
Shen Mo.

146
17:34.893 --> 17:37.093
It's your birthday in a few days.

147
17:38.333 --> 17:39.773
How do you want to celebrate?

148
17:39.773 --> 17:42.772
I never do anything special for my birthday.

149
17:43.492 --> 17:45.812
There's no need to go to any trouble.

150
17:48.732 --> 17:50.532
Then I'll just handle the arrangements.

151
17:55.053 --> 17:56.773
He even knows my birthday.

152
17:56.773 --> 17:59.492
How could he not be Zhou Yang?

153
17:59.492 --> 18:00.972
But what if...

154
18:00.972 --> 18:03.133
What if he's not Zhou Yang?

155
18:03.133 --> 18:04.853
Why is he pretending to be Zhou Yang?

156
18:04.853 --> 18:07.093
And why is he so nice to me?

157
18:09.293 --> 18:10.772
What's wrong?

158
18:11.373 --> 18:12.652
Are you feeling unwell?

159
18:12.652 --> 18:15.252
Yeah, I feel a bit cold.

160
19:17.492 --> 19:19.853
According to the report, you're recovering quite well.

161
19:19.853 --> 19:21.172
Everything looks fine.

162
19:21.172 --> 19:23.532
Just make sure to keep taking your medicine.

163
19:28.172 --> 19:29.772
Doctor.

164
19:30.412 --> 19:33.053
With my condition,

165
19:33.053 --> 19:35.653
is it possible to mistake someone's identity?

166
19:36.652 --> 19:38.452
Mistake someone's identity?

167
19:39.813 --> 19:41.853
Like...

168
19:41.853 --> 19:45.292
Like mistaking a stranger for someone very close to me?

169
19:46.732 --> 19:49.000
People with severe psychological trauma

170
19:49.000 --> 19:51.573
usually choose avoidance.

171
19:51.573 --> 19:54.773
They'll actively try to forget certain events and people.

172
19:54.773 --> 19:57.773
As for mistaking someone's identity,

173
19:57.773 --> 19:59.933
it depends on the specific circumstances.

174
20:00.932 --> 20:02.573
Oh.

175
20:02.573 --> 20:04.933
- I understand. - All right.

176
20:22.893 --> 20:27.212
Hello. The subscriber you have dialed is unavailable at the moment.

177
20:27.212 --> 20:28.613
Please try again later.

178
20:28.613 --> 20:32.573
Sorry, the subscriber you have dialed...

179
21:33.652 --> 21:35.532
I guessed you'd be here.

180
21:39.920 --> 21:41.520
Yeah.

181
21:42.613 --> 21:44.653
Where else would I be?

182
21:49.333 --> 21:51.041
Were you waiting for me?

183
21:54.093 --> 21:55.393
Yes...

184
21:58.732 --> 22:00.032
And no.

185
22:15.652 --> 22:17.732
It's your birthday today.

186
22:19.692 --> 22:21.653
Why didn't you come home?

187
22:27.093 --> 22:29.452
I was thinking about some things.

188
22:30.412 --> 22:32.013
What things?

189
22:34.492 --> 22:36.373
Things from the past.

190
22:41.613 --> 22:43.532
Can you tell me

191
22:44.680 --> 22:47.159
what really happened in the past?

192
22:48.932 --> 22:50.591
Zhou Yang.

193
22:52.972 --> 22:54.693
You're not Zhou Yang.

194
22:58.972 --> 23:00.853
Who are you?

195
23:06.012 --> 23:07.312
You're right.

196
23:09.252 --> 23:11.093
I'm not Zhou Yang.

197
23:14.373 --> 23:16.292
I never was.

198
23:17.412 --> 23:19.573
Since you aren't Zhou Yang, why did you pretend to be him?

199
23:19.573 --> 23:21.492
Pretend to be Zhou Yang?

200
23:22.773 --> 23:25.492
Weren't you the one who mistook me for him first?

201
23:27.773 --> 23:30.373
Then you could have just left me alone.

202
23:30.373 --> 23:32.452
You could have let me crash and burn.

203
23:33.252 --> 23:35.133
Or if you wanted to be kind, you could've just dropped me at a hospital.

204
23:35.133 --> 23:37.373
Why did you have to pretend to be Zhou Yang?

205
23:40.280 --> 23:43.281
At first, I was afraid you'd starve to death in this house.

206
23:44.773 --> 23:46.933
So, I came by occasionally to check on you.

207
23:47.640 --> 23:51.053
But then I realized how stubborn and headstrong you are.

208
23:51.053 --> 23:53.452
I couldn't stop worrying about you.

209
23:54.172 --> 23:57.252
- And then... - And then what?

210
23:57.252 --> 23:58.972
And then what happened?

211
24:15.053 --> 24:17.093
Do you really not know?

212
24:19.012 --> 24:21.173
Do you not know why I chose to stay?

213
24:22.732 --> 24:24.052
Stop it.

214
24:31.252 --> 24:33.252
It's because I love you.

215
24:34.613 --> 24:36.212
Shen Mo.

216
24:57.012 --> 24:58.613
A few days ago...

217
25:00.373 --> 25:02.333
the doctor called me.

218
25:02.333 --> 25:04.613
I already knew your memory was coming back.

219
25:08.773 --> 25:11.052
So, you knew all along.

220
25:12.533 --> 25:14.653
You've just been lying to me.

221
25:19.773 --> 25:22.133
Actually, it's good that you've come to your senses.

222
25:22.133 --> 25:24.532
You can't live in your memories forever.

223
25:25.692 --> 25:26.992
Shen Mo.

224
25:28.972 --> 25:30.853
Pack your things.

225
25:32.560 --> 25:34.441
Come home with me.

226
25:35.732 --> 25:37.212
This is my home.

227
25:37.212 --> 25:39.573
But we've lived together for so long.

228
25:40.932 --> 25:42.373
No.

229
25:42.373 --> 25:43.732
Why not?

230
25:48.492 --> 25:50.252
You're not Zhou Yang.

231
25:54.080 --> 25:56.481
I'm going to wait here for Zhou Yang to return.

232
25:59.452 --> 26:01.413
Zhou Yang is abroad.

233
26:06.200 --> 26:08.133
And you two broke up long ago.

234
26:08.133 --> 26:10.333
That's not true.

235
26:10.333 --> 26:13.813
Zhou Yang and I are only temporarily apart.

236
26:13.813 --> 26:15.315
Shen Mo.

237
26:20.333 --> 26:22.058
Then what about me?

238
26:26.053 --> 26:28.292
I only thought you were Zhou Yang.

239
26:29.480 --> 26:32.119
The one I love has always been Zhou Yang.

240
26:53.533 --> 26:55.050
I'm sorry.

241
26:59.293 --> 27:01.442
The one you love is Zhou Yang.

242
27:04.632 --> 27:06.232
I'm sorry.

243
27:09.920 --> 27:12.750
I shouldn't have entered your life.

244
27:38.818 --> 27:40.578
Take it back.

245
28:50.893 --> 28:53.052
I intended to give it to you anyway.

246
28:54.732 --> 28:56.892
There's no point in me keeping it.

247
29:15.812 --> 29:20.893
From then on, he never appeared before me again.

248
29:20.893 --> 29:23.892
It was as if our lives had never intersected.

249
29:34.640 --> 29:38.240
[Happy Birthday] [(Address of Jinxiu Mountain Villa)]

250
29:38.240 --> 29:41.200
I can't believe he gave me that house.

251
29:41.200 --> 29:42.837
I believe his feelings for me are sincere.

252
29:42.837 --> 29:43.893
[Jinxiu Mountain Villa]

253
29:43.893 --> 29:46.613
I just want to settle things with Zhou Yang

254
29:46.613 --> 29:49.253
before I think about us.

255
29:50.292 --> 29:51.613
That man...

256
29:51.613 --> 29:53.693
Where could he be right now?

257
29:53.693 --> 29:56.332
Is he waiting for me at Jinxiu Mountain Villa?

258
29:56.332 --> 29:58.492
How long will he wait?

259
29:58.492 --> 30:00.012
A week?

260
30:00.012 --> 30:01.933
A month?

261
30:01.933 --> 30:03.532
Or even longer?

262
30:04.893 --> 30:06.332
Zhou Yang.

263
30:10.280 --> 30:11.799
Where are you?

264
30:17.572 --> 30:19.213
Hello?

265
30:19.213 --> 30:21.573
Is this Zhang?

266
30:21.573 --> 30:25.333
Have you seen Zhou Yang lately?

267
30:25.333 --> 30:26.733
Zhou Yang?

268
30:26.733 --> 30:29.093
We haven't been in touch since graduation.

269
30:29.093 --> 30:30.413
Oh, I see.

270
30:30.413 --> 30:31.732
It's okay, never mind.

271
30:31.732 --> 30:33.332
Sorry to bother you.

272
30:36.933 --> 30:38.213
Hello?

273
30:38.213 --> 30:40.613
Have you seen Zhou Yang lately?

274
30:40.613 --> 30:42.933
No clue. I'm busy.

275
30:50.692 --> 30:51.760
Yes, I wanted to ask you,

276
30:51.760 --> 30:54.212
have you seen Zhou Yang lately?

277
30:54.212 --> 30:57.076
I heard he went abroad.

278
30:57.812 --> 30:59.453
Never mind then.

279
31:09.532 --> 31:12.252
That person also said Zhou Yang went abroad.

280
31:12.252 --> 31:13.692
Could it be that Zhou Yang and I

281
31:13.692 --> 31:16.373
just ended things like that, without closure?

282
31:40.772 --> 31:43.333
When I rented this house with Zhou Yang,

283
31:43.333 --> 31:47.692
Zhou Yang said he found someone to handle the paperwork for us.

284
31:47.692 --> 31:49.252
He said it would be more convenient.

285
31:49.252 --> 31:50.920
That way, no one would find out.

286
31:50.920 --> 31:52.011
[Fang Yan Zhou]

287
31:52.012 --> 31:53.240
His surname really is Fang.

288
31:53.240 --> 31:56.012
I remember Zhou Yang always called him "Mr. Fang".

289
31:56.012 --> 31:58.572
He was an employee of the Zhou Group.

290
32:06.692 --> 32:09.491
So, this is the Zhou Group's property.

291
32:11.452 --> 32:12.606
Hello, sir.

292
32:12.606 --> 32:14.813
How can I help you?

293
32:14.813 --> 32:17.173
I'm looking for this person.

294
32:17.173 --> 32:18.772
You must be talking about Secretary Fang.

295
32:18.772 --> 32:20.092
His office is on the sixth floor.

296
32:20.092 --> 32:21.772
You can take the elevator over there.

297
32:21.772 --> 32:24.172
- Okay, thank you. - You're welcome.

298
32:25.640 --> 32:27.319
Hello, Mrs. Zhou.

299
32:34.680 --> 32:35.960
Hey...

300
32:35.960 --> 32:37.960
Why does she look so familiar?

301
32:40.332 --> 32:42.252
Hello, Mrs. Zhou.

302
32:42.252 --> 32:43.413
Mrs. Zhou?

303
32:43.413 --> 32:45.492
Zhou Yang's mother?

304
32:45.492 --> 32:48.693
This time, I'm just teaching you a lesson.

305
32:48.693 --> 32:50.492
Don't ever think of seeing Zhou Yang again.

306
32:50.492 --> 32:52.532
You're not good enough for him.

307
32:52.532 --> 32:54.052
Leave Zhou Yang.

308
32:54.052 --> 32:58.332
Next time, it'll be your family who suffers.

309
33:00.732 --> 33:02.532
I was kidnapped.

310
33:04.732 --> 33:06.372
I was beaten.

311
33:07.732 --> 33:09.892
My fingers were crushed.

312
33:11.040 --> 33:13.386
Those weren't nightmares.

313
33:13.386 --> 33:16.105
They all actually happened.

314
33:16.732 --> 33:18.253
Zhou Yang.

315
33:19.252 --> 33:21.213
Let's break up.

316
33:22.572 --> 33:25.653
No, that wasn't the first time we met.

317
33:25.653 --> 33:27.252
Before I was in the hospital,

318
33:27.252 --> 33:29.292
I must have seen him before.

319
33:43.532 --> 33:45.373
I remember now.

320
33:45.373 --> 33:46.673
He is...

321
33:47.853 --> 33:49.893
His name is Ji Ming Xuan.
